		/// <para>Pointer to an initialized [EVENT_TRACE_PROPERTIES](/windows/desktop/ETW/event-trace-properties) structure. On input, the members must specify the new values for the properties to update. For information on which properties you can update, see Remarks. On output, the structure members contains the updated settings and statistics for the event tracing session.</para>
		/// <para><see href="https://learn.microsoft.com/windows/win32/api/evntrace/nf-evntrace-updatetracew#parameters">Read more on learn.microsoft.com</see>.</para>
