		/// </param>
		/// <param name="PropertyArrayCount">
		/// <para>Number of structures in the _PropertyArray_ array. This value must be less than or equal to 64, the maximum number of event tracing sessions that ETW supports. **Windows 10:** _PropertyArrayCount_ may be larger than 64 and some systems may support more than 64 tracing sessions.</para>
