		/// <summary>Creates a new process and its primary thread. Then the new process runs the specified executable file in the security context of the specified credentials (user, domain, and password). It can optionally load the user profile for a specified user.</summary>
		/// <param name="lpUsername">
		/// <para>The name of the user. This is the name of the user account to log on to. If you use the UPN format, <i>user</i>@<i>DNS_domain_name</i>, the <i>lpDomain</i> parameter must be NULL.</para>
