		/// <summary>Changes the order of available Windows Sockets (Winsock) 2 namespace providers in a 32-bit catalog.</summary>
		/// <param name="lpProviderId">
		/// <para>An array of <b>NSProviderId</b> elements as found in the <a href="https://docs.microsoft.com/windows/desktop/api/winsock2/ns-winsock2-wsanamespace_infow">WSANAMESPACE_INFO</a> structure.  The order of the <b>NSProviderId</b> elements is the new priority ordering for the namespace providers.</para>
