ter in Unicode. The maximum length, in wide characters, of the string returned in the buffer pointed to by the <i>name</i> parameter is dependent on the namespace provider, but this string must be 256 wide characters or less. So if a buffer of 256 wide characters is passed in the <i>name</i> parameter and the <i>namelen</i> parameter is set to 256, the buffer size will always be adequate.</para>
