		/// <para>If successful, the <b>WSAStartup</b> function returns zero. Otherwise, it returns one of the error codes listed below. The <b>WSAStartup</b> function directly returns the extended error code in the return value for this function. A call to the <a href="https://docs.microsoft.com/windows/desktop/api/winsock/nf-winsock-wsagetlasterror">WSAGetLastError</a> function is not needed and should  not be used.</para>
