		/// <summary>The IpReleaseAddress function releases an IPv4 address previously obtained through the Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol (DHCP).</summary>
		/// <param name="AdapterInfo">
		/// <para>A pointer to an <a href="https://docs.microsoft.com/windows/desktop/api/ipexport/ns-ipexport-ip_adapter_index_map">IP_ADAPTER_INDEX_MAP</a> structure that specifies the adapter associated with the IPv4 address to release.</para>
