/b> member of the <a href="https://docs.microsoft.com/windows/desktop/api/netioapi/ns-netioapi-mib_ipinterface_row">MIB_IPINTERFACE_ROW</a> structure of the associated interface.  An application can retrieve the interface metric by calling the <a href="https://docs.microsoft.com/windows/desktop/api/netioapi/nf-netioapi-getipinterfaceentry">GetIpInterfaceEntry</a> function. The <a href="https://docs.microsoft.com/windows/desktop/api/netioapi/nf-netioapi-getipforwardtable2">GetIpForwardTable2</a> function can be called to enumerate the IP route entries on a local computer.</para>
