			/// <summary>
			/// <para>The neighbor is no longer known to be reachable, and probes are being sent to verify reachability. For IPv6, a reachability confirmation is actively being sought by regularly retransmitting unicast Neighbor Solicitation probes until a reachability confirmation is received.</para>
